lyra-setup-title = Welcome to Lyra Browser
lyra-setup-subtitle = A few steps to get settled in.

lyra-setup-welcome = Lyra Browser is a privacy-focused browser. This short setup imports your data, picks your protections, and sets your defaults.

lyra-setup-import-title = Import your data
lyra-setup-import-desc = Bring bookmarks, passwords and history from Chrome, Edge, Opera, Opera GX, Brave, Chromium, Vivaldi or another Firefox profile.
lyra-setup-import-button = Choose what to import
lyra-setup-import-hint = You can also do this later from Settings.

lyra-setup-privacy-title = Privacy protections
lyra-setup-privacy-desc = These are on by default. Toggle what you want. Everything is also in Settings later.
lyra-setup-fingerprint = Fingerprinting mode
lyra-setup-fingerprint-firefox = Blend in with other Firefox users
lyra-setup-fingerprint-crowd = Resist Fingerprinting (stronger, some sites may break)
lyra-setup-webrtc = Protect WebRTC from leaking local addresses
lyra-setup-sensors = Block device sensors and gamepad access
lyra-setup-geo-legend = Location
lyra-setup-geo = Block geolocation prompts
lyra-setup-geo-spoof = Spoof GPS (Reykjavik, matches UTC)
lyra-setup-geo-ask = Ask each site (BeaconDB lookup)
lyra-setup-lan = Block websites reaching your local network
lyra-setup-querystrip = Strip tracking parameters from links

lyra-setup-search-title = Default search engine
lyra-setup-search-desc = Seek is the default. Pick what you prefer.

lyra-setup-theme-title = Choose a theme
lyra-setup-theme-desc = Built-in themes only, nothing is fetched.

lyra-setup-done-title = All set
lyra-setup-done-desc = Everything here can be changed later in Settings.

lyra-setup-back = Back
lyra-setup-next = Continue
lyra-setup-finish = Start browsing
